Tab. 12. Fig. 1. 2. 3.</hi>             </note>             <lb/>
<note place="end" n="2)" xml:id="end37b" prev="#end37a">Der Stachel&#x017F;chweinmann <hi rendition="#aq">G. Edwards <hi rendition="#i">Gleanings of<lb/>
