<note place="end" n="3)" xml:id="end38b" prev="#end38a"><hi rendition="#aq">v. Fel. Plater <hi rendition="#i">Ob&#x017F;. med</hi>.</hi> S. 140. <hi rendition="#aq">D.</hi> Langhans<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Merkw. des Siementhals</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">Bourrit <hi rendition="#i">Mont-<lb/>
Blanc</hi> p. 80. Haller <hi rendition="#i">de vento Ruben&#x017F;i</hi> Nov. Comm.<lb/>
Goett. T. I. p. 43.</hi></note>             <lb/>
<note place="end" n="4)" xml:id="end39b" prev="#end39a">Z. B. <hi rendition="#aq">in Guidant <hi rendition="#i">variat. de la nat. dans l&#x2019;e&#x017F;pece<lb/>
